  "title": "Spectral-Spatial Synergistic Guided Network and FressDet for Multispectral Object Detection",
  "summary": "S3GNet proposes a parameter-free Spectral Structure-Aware Module and Stream-Aware Attention Module to enhance spectral-spatial collaboration and robustness, while FressDet introduces a fully rotation-equivariant framework for multispectral detection. Both methods address limitations of existing methods and achieve superior performance.",
